+1. Article and Sections IV--V
+-----------------------------
+C. M. Bender and L. M. A. Bettencourt, "Multiple-scale analysis of
+quantum systems", Physical Review D 54, 7710--7723 (1996),
+DOI 10.1103/PhysRevD.54.7710, arXiv:hep-th/9607074.  The supplied PDF is the
+correct primary source.  Section IV (PDF pp. 14--24) repeatedly sums growing
+polynomial diagonals of the anharmonic-oscillator RS wavefunction, beginning
+with BB (4.8)--(4.14), then reorganizing the new polynomial arrays in
+(4.15)--(4.32), and finally relating their large-order pattern (4.33)--(4.45)
+to WKB.  Section V (PDF pp. 24--28) obtains the same exponent hierarchy by
+multiple scales (5.1)--(5.13), including the ordinary energy corrections.
